[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 542.59, "timestamp": "00:09:02", "text": "夢想的星座。我只是一顆懷抱"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 546.31, "timestamp": "00:09:06", "text": "夢想的星星。但我也希望"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 549.35, "timestamp": "00:09:09", "text": "我的社區也能有一些習俗之類的東西，你知道，就是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 559.59, "timestamp": "00:09:19", "text": "你可以在那裡建立 YouTube 帳號等等，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 561.91, "timestamp": "00:09:21", "text": "登入等等，將你的帳號連接到"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 568.11, "timestamp": "00:09:28", "text": "網站，然後關聯你的 Twitch 帳號"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 570.71, "timestamp": "00:09:30", "text": "等等。當然，兄弟，我想要那些"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 594.63, "timestamp": "00:09:54", "text": "，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 596.47, "timestamp": "00:09:56", "text": "現在人生有很多畢業典禮。好了，我要走了，我有點"}]